<title>CANADA: Canada June bankruptcies rise over year. [CORRECTED 13:02 GMT]</title>
<headline>Canada June bankruptcies rise over year. [CORRECTED 13:02 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankruptcies in Canada rose to 7,268 in June from 6,650 a year earlier, the Department of Consumer and Corporate Affairs said on Tuesday. (Corrects June, 1996 figure.)</p>
<p>The department said 1,055 businesses and 6,213 consumers went bankrupt in the month.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Ottawa Bureau (613) 235-6745</p>
